
Daim-teev thaum-tuaj: ['product'] ua: {
	>> total := 1.
	tus-kheej txhua: { :index :element
		total khoo-nrog: element.
	}. <- total.
}.

>> a := Daim-teev ← 1 ; 2 ; 3.
Tawm sau-ntawv: a product, kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: (Daim-teev ← 2 ; 4 ; 8) product, kab-tshiab. 
Tawm sau-ntawv: (Daim-teev ← -2 ; 10) product, kab-tshiab. 
Tawm sau-ntawv: (Daim-teev ← 0.5 ; -2) product, kab-tshiab. 
